    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53867" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταδᾰτέομαι</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-δάσομαι</span> (v. infr.):—
			Med.
		, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>divide among
				themselves, tear and devour</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύνες κατὰ πάντα δάσονται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					22.354
				</span></i>
			:— 
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπ᾽ ἰχθύων
			καταδασθῆναι</span> (nisi leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατεδεσθῆναι</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Demon.</u>
				35
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταδέδασται: καταβέβρωται,
				καταμεμέρισται</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰν γᾶν κατεδασσάμεθα</span>
			<i>divided, allotted</i> it, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Tab.Heracl.</u>
				2.28
			</span></i>.</div>
